  "description": "The latest planning application on record for the premises is: Use of premises for tattooing and body piercing. (ref C2002/48729) which is a Sui Generis use and I understand that a change to use class E would require permission. \nIt is currently is use as a beauty salon, also Sui Generis which following some appeal decisions issued by the Planning Inspectorate is treated as use class E however, as this use was not applied for, and not in place for at least 10 years (which would make it established use even without planning permission) it seems I would require a full planning application for a change of use. This application is for change of use from SUIS GENERIS TO CLASS E. I am providing existing plans for beauty salon and proposed plans for Butchers shop.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIt seems that it is currently in use as a beauty salon, which following some appeal decisions issued by the Planning Inspectorate is treated as use class E (so the same use class as the grocers/butcher) however, as this use was not applied for, and not in place for at least 10 years (which would make it established use even without planning permission) it seems you would require a full planning application for a change of use.",
